itle><description>Ohne Hamburg keine Beatles! Am 19. November findet ihr alle Folgen von "Becoming The Beatles" in der ARD Audiothek.</description><guid>https://www.ardsounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:5f921b5bf5e79d65/</guid><link>https://www.ardsounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:5f921b5bf5e79d65/</link><enclosure url="https://ndr-podcast.ard-mcdn.de/progressive/2024/1113/AU-20241113-1547-0600.mp3" length="1514391" type="audio/mp3" /><media:content url="https://ndr-podcast.ard-mcdn.de/progressive/2024/1113/AU-20241113-1547-0600.mp3" medium="audio" duration="93" type="audio/mp3" /><pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 16:30:00 +0100</pubDate><itunes:duration>93</itunes:duration><itunes:image href="https://api.ardmediathek.de/image-service/images/urn:ard:image:5b6dbbc4ec0f6314?w=448&amp;ch=9abc544eff9ff7c9" /></item></channel></rss>